      "message": "Kleaf is currently unsetting MODULE_SIG_PROTECT when export protection is to be disabled (in debug builds?).\n\nIs this going to work correctly here? Should it be blanking `MODULE_SIG_PROTECT_LIST` instead?\n\nAlternatively, do you need to always:\n\n```\n#ifdef MODULE_SIG_PROTECT\n#ifdef MODULE_SIG_PROTECT_LIST (you know what I mean)\n...\n#endif\n#endif\n```",
