      "writtenOn": "2025-11-11T08:16:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think `#ifdef MODULE_SIG_PROTECT_LIST` can be used to detect if a value for the associated config option is set, which is why I introduced the boolean config option `MODULE_SIG_PROTECT `. Value for `MODULE_SIG_PROTECT` is determined based on the value of `MODULE_SIG_PROTECT_LIST`:\n\n* `MODULE_SIG_PROTECT` is `y` if `MODULE_SIG_PROTECT_LIST` is a not empty\n* `MODULE_SIG_PROTECT` is `n` if `MODULE_SIG_PROTECT_LIST` is an empty string\n\nKleaf should set `MODULE_SIG_PROTECT_LIST` to a valid filepath or empty string depending on whether symbol export protection should be used.",
